      "JESSICA: You're not that Wilson that's a fortune taller, are you?\nJESSICA: I'd love for you to read my fortune.\nANNIE: I'm pretty booked up...\nJESSICA: So do you think we'll live happily ever after?",
      "ANNIE: I don't know why I let you talk me into this.\nLINDA: 'Cause it's time you quit livin' like a nun.",
      "ANNIE: I'm not. I just kinda tagged along with Linda.\nJESSICA: How nice... That's a great outfit. So... demure.",
      "ANNIE: Awhile... but...\nLINDA: I'll dance.",
      "ANNIE: Eric, why don't you just sit yourself down, while I go lookin' for the ladies' room.\nLINDA: It's on the other side of the band down that little hallway. Take your time! - Now where'd you get that tie?"
